  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Hi all，<br style=\"\" />【春日繁花盛宴】活动将于3.10日进入测试阶段，现申请相关资源及礼物配置。<br style=\"\" />辛苦@叶导 审批，&nbsp;<br style=\"\" />辛苦@灿灿配置并返回相关id。</p><p>1、资源配置</p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 66.4pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 116.8pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 367.2pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>类型</td><td>奖励名称</td><td>id</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>资料卡浮屏</td><td>爱意绵绵资料卡浮屏</td><td>9454</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY1Mjg1ODU0NzUzMiMzNjEjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY1Mjg1ODU0NzUzMiMzNjEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY1Mjg1ODU0NzUzMiMzNjEjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>主页挂件</td><td>春日繁花主页挂件</td><td>4174</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY5MzgyMTQxNDQ1NSMyNDEjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY5MzgyMTQxNDQ1NSMyNDEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY5MzgyMTQxNDQ1NSMyNDEjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>主页挂件</td><td>繁花加冕主页挂件</td><td>9483</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc2ODk3NzMyNTY1OCMgNTQjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc2ODk3NzMyNTY1OCMgNTQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc2ODk3NzMyNTY1OCMgNTQjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>春日繁花头像框</td><td>7176</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzI2MTQ1MCMyNTgjcG5n.png\" title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzI2MTQ1MCMyNTgjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzI2MTQ1MCMyNTgjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>花间闪耀</td><td>7174</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzIyMjA2NiM4MDQjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzIyMjA2NiM4MDQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzIyMjA2NiM4MDQjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>繁花加冕动态头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>锦绣赏客头像框</td><td>1918</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYxNjQ5NDU5NzYwMSMgMjYjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYxNjQ5NDU5NzYwMSMgMjYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYxNjQ5NDU5NzYwMSMgMjYjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>盛世芳华动态头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>上麦动效</td><td>繁花加冕上麦动效</td><td>4517</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwMjI4MDkxMzc4MiMgIDQjcG5n.png\" title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwMjI4MDkxMzc4MiMgIDQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwMjI4MDkxMzc4MiMgIDQjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>花间闪耀</td><td>7178</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzMwNzI1MyM2NzMjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzMwNzI1MyM2NzMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzMwNzI1MyM2NzMjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>锦绣赏客麦序框</td><td>6990</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MjM1MTU2NzI5OSM4MjkjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MjM1MTU2NzI5OSM4MjkjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MjM1MTU2NzI5OSM4MjkjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>春日繁花麦序框</td><td>7180</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzM1MDEzMyM5MzUjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzM1MDEzMyM5MzUjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NDk0NzM1MDEzMyM5MzUjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>公聊皮肤</td><td>花间闪耀公聊皮肤</td><td>6836</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MDk4MzEzMDUzOCMzODgjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MDk4MzEzMDUzOCMzODgjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MDk4MzEzMDUzOCMzODgjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>公聊皮肤</td><td>盛世芳华公聊皮肤</td><td>6824</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY0ODYzNTgxNzIwMSM5NjcjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY0ODYzNTgxNzIwMSM5NjcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY0ODYzNTgxNzIwMSM5NjcjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>浮屏挂件</td><td>爱意绵绵浮屏挂件</td><td>5121</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNTc1NTU4NDI2NCM5MDcjcG5n.png\" title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNTc1NTU4NDI2NCM5MDcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxNTc1NTU4NDI2NCM5MDcjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>浮屏</td><td>春日繁花主页浮屏</td><td>6594</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczOTE4NTIzMTk2MSMxOTMjcG5n.png\" title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczOTE4NTIzMTk2MSMxOTMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczOTE4NTIzMTk2MSMxOTMjcG5n.png</a></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>称号</td><td>春日繁花称号</td><td><br /></td><td rowspan=\"7\">3.14-3.18 春日繁花盛宴活动获得~</td><td>新配置</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>称号</td><td>花间闪耀称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>称号</td><td>繁花加冕称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>称号</td><td>锦绣赏客称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>称号</td><td>盛世芳华称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>公聊角标</td><td>春日繁花</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>公聊角标</td><td>花间闪耀</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>热13推荐卡</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>10min*7天</td><td>新配置</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">2、礼物配置</p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 77.6pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 61.2pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 128.4pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>礼物名称</td><td>幸运礼物B</td><td>礼物id</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秘密花园</td><td>399</td><td><br /></td><td rowspan=\"9\">幸运礼物b</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>清凉一夏</td><td>999</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>走到白头</td><td>1999</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>爱心泡泡机</td><td>2666</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>梦幻礼盒</td><td>3999</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>夜诗颂歌</td><td>5200</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>水晶奇遇</td><td>9999</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>誓言</td><td>18888</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>漫游世界</td><td>66666</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秘密花园*4</td><td>1596</td><td><br /></td><td rowspan=\"9\">0钻活动礼物，0经验值</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>清凉一夏*4</td><td>3996</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>走到白头*4</td><td>7996</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>爱心泡泡机*4</td><td>10664</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>梦幻礼盒*4</td><td>15996</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>夜诗颂歌*4</td><td>20800</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>水晶奇遇*4</td><td>39996</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>誓言*4</td><td>75552</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>漫游世界*4</td><td>266664</td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 77.6pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 61.2pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 128.4pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 168.35pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>礼物名称</td><td>礼物价格</td><td>资源 id</td><td>礼物id</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>繁花小映</td><td>1888钻</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>模版六</td><td>新，幸运</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">以上如有问题，及时沟通～</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p>",
